{"output":"I’ll inspect project authorization and list caching, fix the isolation gaps, then run the existing tests without changing them or installing dependencies.\n\nProject reads lack an ownership membership check, list cache keys omit the organization, and updates never invalidate cached lists. List authorization already runs before cache lookup; I’ll preserve that and add regression tests for unauthorized access, cache variants, and organization-specific invalidation.\n\nFixed owning-organization authorization for project reads and updates. Cache keys now isolate organizations while preserving pagination and sorting. Updates invalidate all affected organization list variants without evicting unrelated lists. Cached results still require membership.\n\nAdded regression tests; existing tests unchanged. No dependencies installed.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 11 tests; git diff --check passed. Exit code 0.","final_output":"Fixed owning-organization authorization for project reads and updates. Cache keys now isolate organizations while preserving pagination and sorting. Updates invalidate all affected organization list variants without evicting unrelated lists. Cached results still require membership.\n\nAdded regression tests; existing tests unchanged. No dependencies installed.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 11 tests; git diff --check passed. Exit code 0.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":8,"tool_calls":[{"name":"skill","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"pwd; git status --short; rg --files -g '!node_modules' -g '!package-lock.json' -g '!yarn.lock' ","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-batching-025sltl2/tenant-cache-2-optimized/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":375,"stdout_bytes":549,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-d506bbec7282b860891671308bd8c5bc.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},